F022 [feature·stated] Rear split seat standard: 60:40 split rear seat (conditions: Standard all ten trim columns.) (source: src_reviewed_creta_pdf; locator: PDF page 37; quote: "60:40 split rear seat\n S\n S\n S\n S\n S\n S\n S\n S\n S\n S")
